      "instance_name": "piscuit",
      "label": "piscuit",
      "description": "A humorous, pun-based term coined by the meme creator to refer to the urinal cake, playing on the visual resemblance of the object to a biscuit or cookie. The term 'piscuit' is a portmanteau of 'piscis' (Latin for fish) and 'biscuit', implying a fish-shaped biscuit, which is a real-world concept of a food item. This pun relies on the viewer's knowledge of food terminology and wordplay to understand the joke.",
