      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with public restroom culture and wordplay humor. The humor relies on recognizing the visual resemblance of the urinal cake to a biscuit and understanding the pun 'piscuit', which requires general knowledge of food items and language play. The target community includes individuals who use or encounter public restrooms, appreciate visual puns, and engage with internet memes. There are no specific demographic, cultural, or community markers that target a narrow group; the joke is accessible to anyone with basic comprehension of the objects and language involved.",
